				<title>战争雷霆波兰独立日双活动：P-47M雷电限时上架，贴花奖杯免费领</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-11-11-236390-8d44c103/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:31:45 +0800</pubDate>
